Subject: [06] Check for prelude objects before filesystem identity queries, forced save of 39 CHERI theories

Measurement: 6.05 → 1.76 s. 456 → 52 MB. File-information calls fell from 296,172 to 954. The saved binaries matched byte-for-byte.

diff --git a/src/save-theories.lisp b/src/save-theories.lisp
index b0687d8..a38abbc 100644
--- a/src/save-theories.lisp
+++ b/src/save-theories.lisp
@@ -149,8 +149,8 @@ instances, e.g., other declarations within the theory, or self-references."
 				     (id (adt obj))))))))
 
 (defmethod external-library-reference? ((obj datatype-or-module))
-  (and (not (file-equal (context-path obj) *default-pathname-defaults*))
